      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHALLOW SALLY (8) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.1 lengths from the winner DID SO (25.44) at Ballarat. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Expected to feature in the finish again. DID SO (4) was sent out big odds last time but scored an upset win in a Grade 5 at Ballarat (25.36). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. LEKTRA ISA (6) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (25.64) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Can figure in the finish. NARINGAL LAD (1) generally performs well over this distance.",
